---
import { SITE_AUTHOR } from '../consts';
const today = new Date();
const veilxOrderUrl = 'https://veilx.io/#/hello/3B2WSRN2';
---
<footer>
  <div class="site-shell promo-cdn" aria-label="Veilx CDN 推广">
    <div class="promo-cdn-main">
      <a class="promo-cdn-brand" href={veilxOrderUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored" aria-label="Veilx CDN 推广链接">
        <img class="promo-cdn-logo" src="/images/veilx-logo.svg" width="32" height="32" alt="Veilx CDN" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="promo-cdn-brand-text">
          <strong>Veilx CDN</strong>
          <em>veilx.io</em>
        </span>
      </a>
      <div class="promo-cdn-copy">
        <strong>很多站长不知道，推荐你使用 <span class="promo-cdn-name">Veilx CDN</span></strong>
        <ul>
          <li>全国多地节点覆盖，秒开不卡顿</li>
          <li>99.9% SLA 服务保障，业务永不掉线</li>
          <li>一对一技术支持，配置不懂随时问</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="promo-cdn-link" href={veilxOrderUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer sponsored">Veilx CDN 下单</a>
  </div>
  <div class="site-shell disclaimer">本站仅用于个人研究和策略复盘，不构成投资建议。数据可能延迟、缺失或错误；历史表现不代表未来收益，交易风险由使用者自行承担。</div>
  <div class="site-shell copyright">© {today.getFullYear()} {SITE_AUTHOR} · 个人研究记录</div>
</footer>
<style>
  footer { padding: 2.2rem 0 3.2rem; color: rgb(var(--gray)); background: var(--warm); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  footer strong { color: rgb(var(--black)); }
  .promo-cdn { margin-top: 0; padding: 0.95rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.55); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  .promo-cdn-main { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem; min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
  .promo-cdn-brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .promo-cdn-logo { width: 32px; height: 32px; display: block; border-radius: 8px; background: #1f1f26; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(64,105,246,.18); }
  .promo-cdn-brand-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.05rem; line-height: 1.15; }
  .promo-cdn-brand-text strong { font-size: 0.98rem; letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #14243b; }
  .promo-cdn-brand-text em { font-style: normal; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: lowercase; }
  .promo-cdn-copy { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
  .promo-cdn-copy > strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .promo-cdn-name { color: #4069f6; }
  .promo-cdn-copy ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
  }
  .promo-cdn-copy li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 0.85rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .promo-cdn-copy li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.45em;
    width: 0.35rem;
    height: 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #14243b;
  }
  .promo-cdn-link { flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 2.2rem; padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem; border-radius: 999px; background: #14243b; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.84rem; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; }
  .promo-cdn-link:hover { opacity: 0.92; color: #fff; }
  .copyright { margin-top: 1.35rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgb(var(--gray)); }
  .disclaimer { margin-top: 1.1rem; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.48); border: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 0.78rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .disclaimer + .copyright { margin-top: 0.7rem; }
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .promo-cdn { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .promo-cdn-main { width: 100%; }
    .promo-cdn-copy ul { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .promo-cdn-copy li { white-space: normal; }
    .promo-cdn-link { margin-left: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .promo-cdn { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .promo-cdn-main { width: 100%; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .promo-cdn-copy ul { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.35rem; }
    .promo-cdn-link { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
